  m_text: 'In my house, you can find the foraged ingredients stored in <b>boxes</b>.


    You
    can also find the <b>cauldron</b>, essential for brewing any potion.


    Additionally,
    a <b>bellows</b> is used to adjust the temperature, and a <b>cutting board</b>
    and a <b>mortar</b> are also available on the tables.

'
